  <para style="h">Rusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca Rusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Rusi</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nawomi na Rusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Mu gihe Abisirayeli baganzwa n’abacamanza, hateye inzara mu gihugu, maze umugabo umwe w’i Betelehemu mu karere ka Yuda, hamwe n’umugore wiwe n’abahungu biwe babiri, baja kuba baraba mu gihugu c’i Mowabu. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Uwo mugabo yitwa Elimeleki, umugore wiwe yitwa Nawomi, abahungu biwe na bo bitwa Mahiloni na Kiliyoni. Abo bari Abanyefurata baba i Betelehemu, mu karere ka Yuda. Nuko baja i Mowabu babayo.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Haheze igihe, Elimeleki, umugabo wa Nawomi, arapfa, Nawomi asigarana n’abahungu biwe babiri. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Mu nyuma abo bahungu barongora Abanyamowabukazi, umwe yitwa Orupa uwundi akitwa Rusi. Bamazeyo nk’imyaka icumi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Mahiloni na Kiliyoni na bo nyene barapfa. Nawomi asigara wenyene abahungu biwe bompi n’umugabo wiwe bamaze gupfa.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rusi afata ingingo yo kugumana na Nawomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Nawomi akiri i Mowabu yumva ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatabaye abantu biwe akabarungikira ivyokurya. Nuko yitegura gusubira mu gihugu ciwe hamwe n’abakazana biwe. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Ava aho yaba ari kumwe n’abakazana biwe bafata inzira isubira mu karere ka Yuda.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Ariko Nawomi abwira abakazana biwe ati: “Nimwisubirire inyuma, umwe wese aje mu nzu kwa nyina. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze abagirire neza nk’uko mwatugiriye twe n’abahisi. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze abahe impore mu ngo muzoja kwubakamwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Nuko arabagumbira arabasezera, bose bararira cane, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />baca baramubwira bati: “Turajana nawe mu bwoko bw’iwanyu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Ariko Nawomi arababwira ati: “Nimwisubirire iwanyu, bakobwa banje. Ni igiki cotuma mujana nanje? Mbega nzosubira kuvyara abandi bahungu, ngo bababere abagabo? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Nimwitahire iwanyu, bakobwa banje; kuko ndashaje cane nta mugabo wundi nkironka. Naho nokwiyumvira ko ngifise ibindi vyizigiro vyo kuronka umugabo iri joro nyene nkavyara abahungu, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />mbega mwobarindira gushika bakuze? Mworeka kurongorwa mubarindiriye? Oya ntivyokunda, bakobwa banje. Ivyanje ni umururazi kurusha ivyanyu, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubwiwe yambanguriye ukuboko kwiwe!”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Bumvise ivyo bongera kurira cane. Maze Orupa agumbira inabukwe aramusezera, ariko Rusi amwumirako.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Nawomi abwira Rusi ati: “Raba mugenzawe arisubiriye mu b’iwabo no ku mana ziwe. Ehe jana na we.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ariko Rusi aramwishura ati: “Reka kunyingingira kuvana nawe canke gusubira inyuma ngo ndaguhebe. Aho uzoja ni ho nzoja, aho uzoba ni ho nzoba. Ihanga ryawe ni ryo rizoba ihanga ryanje kandi Imana yawe ni yo izoba Imana yanje. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Aho uzopfira ni ho nzopfira, kandi ni ho bazompamba. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze abimpanire, mbere birushirije, nihagira ikintandukanya na wewe atari urupfu.” <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Nawomi amaze kubona ko Rusi yafashe ingingo ntabanduka yo kujana na we, ntiyasubira kumwinginga.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Abo bagore uko ari babiri baragenda gushika bashitse i Betelehemu. Bahashitse, abo mu gisagara bose bazira rimwe kubaraba. Abagore baho baravuga bati: “Mbega uwu si Nawomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Na we arababwira ati: “Ntimunyite Nawomi, munyite Mara, kuko Iyishoboravyose yahinduye ubuzima bwanje umururazi ukomeye. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Nkigenda nta co nari nkenye, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> angarukanye ata kintu na kimwe mfise. None ni igiki cotuma munyita Nawomi? <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanteje amagorwa; Iyishoboravyose yanteje ivyago.”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Nuko Nawomi agaruka avuye i Mowabu ari kumwe n’umukazana wiwe Rusi, Umunyamowabukazi, bashika i Betelehemu mu gihe iyimbura ry’ingano ryari ritanguye.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rusi ahura na Bowazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Nawomi yari afise incuti ku ruhande rw’umugabo wiwe, umugabo yari atunze kandi w’umwubahwa wo mu muryango wa Elimeleki, yitwa Bowazi.<verse eid="RUT 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Umusi umwe Rusi wa Munyamowabukazi abwira Nawomi ati: “Nyemerera nje mu mirima ntoratore ingano zakorotse inyuma y’umuntu wese aza kundaba ijisho ryiza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Nawomi aramubwira ati: “Genda mwana wanje.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Nuko aragenda atangura gutoratora ingano zasigaye mu mirima inyuma y’abimbuzi. Maze birahurirana asanga ariko atoratora mu murima wa Bowazi, wo mu muryango wa Elimeleki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Maze Bowazi aca arashika avuye i Betelehemu, aramutsa abimbuzi ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abane namwe!” Baramwishura bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhe umugisha!”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Bowazi abaza umukozi yari ajejwe abimbuzi ati: “Urya mukobwa ni uwa nde?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Uwo mukozi aramwishura ati: “Ni wa Munyamowabukazi yazanana na Nawomi bavuye i Mowabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Yaje asaba ati: ‘Ndabinginze mundeke ntoratore utwasigaye hagati y’imikama inyuma y’abimbuzi.’ Yaje mu murima kuva mu gitondo kandi gushika n’ubu ntarahagarika gukora, uretse akanya gato yicaye mu gitutu ngo aruhuke.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Nuko Bowazi abwira Rusi ati: “Mukobwa wanje, nyumviriza. Ntuze uje gutoratora ingano mu wundi murima kandi ntuze uje kure y’aha. Uze ugumane n’abakobwa bankorera. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Uze urabe umurima abimbuzi banje bariko barimburamwo, hanyuma ugende ukurikira abakobwa bankorera. Nihanije abakozi ngo ntihagire uwugukorako. Kandi unyotewe, uzoce ugenda wihe amazi yo kunywa ku mibindi abakozi bavomye.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Amubwiye ivyo, Rusi aca aramwunamira, amubwira ati: “Ni igiki gitumye ngirirwa ubuntu imbere yawe ngo unyiteho, jewe umunyamahangakazi?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Bowazi aramwishura ati: “Barambwiye ivyo wakoreye nyokobukwe vyose kuva umugabo wawe apfuye, ko wahevye so na nyoko n’igihugu c’amavukiro ukaza kuba mu bantu utigeze umenya. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, uwo waje guhungira musi y’amababa, aze aguhembere ivyo wakoze. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze akwishure birushirije.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Rusi aramubwira ati: “Icompa ngashishikara kugirirwa ubuntu imbere yawe, Nyakwubahwa. Urandemesheje kandi umbwiye amajambo meza jewe umusavyikazi wawe, naho ntari mpwanye n’umwe mu bakobwa bagukorera.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Hageze gufungura, Bowazi aramubwira ati: “Ingo hano. Niwakire umukate ukoze mu muvinyu w’inkarisha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:14">Maze yicaye hamwe n’abimbuzi, amuha intete zikaranze. Ararya arahaga kandi aranasigaza. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Ahagurutse ngo atoratore ingano zakorotse, Bowazi ategeka abimbuzi biwe ati: “Naho yotoratora hagati y’imikama, ntimumugore. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Ahubwo, muze murakororera hasi ingano zimwe kugira ngo azitoratore, kandi ntimumukarire.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Nuko Rusi atorora ingano muri uwo murima gushika ku mugoroba. Asekuye izo yegeranije, akwiza ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 13.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Araheza azijana mu gisagara, maze inabukwe abona ingene yegeranije ingano nyinshi. Kandi Rusi arongera asokorora ivyo yari yashigaje ahejeje gufungura agahaga, arabimuha.<verse eid="RUT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Inabukwe aramubaza ati: “Mbega watoratoye he uwu musi? Wakoreye he? Uwo mugabo yakwitayeho aragahezagirwa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Maze Rusi abwira inabukwe nyene aho hantu yakoreye. Aravuga ati: “Izina ry’uwo mugabo nyene umurima nakoreyemwo uno musi ni Bowazi.”<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Nawomi abwira umukazana wiwe ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuhezagire. Ntiyigeze ahagarika kugirira neza twebwe abazima n’abahisi.” Arongerako ati: “Urya mugabo ni incuti yacu ya hafi; ni umwe mu bacunguzi bacu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Maze Rusi Umunyamowabukazi aravuga ati: “Kandi yambwiye ngo: ‘Uze ugumane n’abakozi banje kugeza bahejeje kwegeranya umwimbu wanje wose.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Nawomi abwira Rusi umukazana wiwe ati: “Bizokubera vyiza, mukobwa wanje, kujana n’abakobwa bamukorera, kuko ugiye mu murima w’uwundi muntu wohava ugira ingorane.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Nuko Rusi aguma hafi y’abakobwa bakorera Bowazi atorora gushika iyimbura rya sayiri n’ingano rirangiye. Kandi ico gihe yabana na inabukwe.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Rusi na Bowazi ku mbuga yo kugosorerako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Umusi umwe Nawomi, inabukwe wa Rusi, aramubwira ati: “Mukobwa wanje, ntegerezwa kukuronderera urugo, ahantu uzoshobora kuronka ibigutunga. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Bowazi, shebuja wa barya bakobwa mwakorana, ni umucunguzi wacu. Muri iri joro ahava aja kugosoza sayiri ku mbuga yo kugosorerako. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Niwiyuhagire maze wisige, uheze wambare agahuzu keza kurusha izindi. Maze umanuke ku mbuga, ariko ntamenye ko ari ho uri kugeza ahejeje kurya no kunywa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Niyaryama, urabe neza ahantu aryamye. Hanyuma uce ugenda umupfukure ibirenge vyiwe uce uryama. Azoheza akubwire ico ukwiye gukora.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Rusi arishura ati: “Ndakora ivyo umbwiye vyose.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Nuko aramanuka aja ku mbuga yo kugosorerako akora ivyo inabukwe yamubwiye gukora vyose.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Maze Bowazi ahejeje kurya no kunywa ahaze, aca aja kuryama i ruhande y’ikigunguzi c’imikama ya sayiri. Rusi aramwegera mu gacerere, apfukura ibirenge vyiwe araryama. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ijoro rigeze hagati, sinzi icakomye uwo mugabo, arihindukiza maze asanga hari umugore aryamye ku birenge vyiwe.<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Arabaza ati: “Uri nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Aravuga ati: “Ndi umuguranokazi wawe Rusi. Numpfuke igice co hepfo c’impuzu yawe, kuko uri umucunguzi w’umuryango wanje.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Arishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhezagire, mukobwa wanje. Ugize neza gusumba n’ubwa mbere: ntiwakurikiye abagabo bakiri bato, baba abatunze canke abakenye. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />None rero, mukobwa wanje, ntutinye. Nzokora ivyo wasavye vyose. Abagabo bagenzanje bo mu gisagara bose barazi ko uri umugore w’imico myiza. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Naho vy’ukuri ndi umucunguzi, hari umucunguzi andusha kuba uwa hafi. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Guma ngaha iri joro, maze mu gitondo niyashima kugucungura, bizoba ari vyiza; azogucungura. Ariko niyo atabishima, ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> jewe nzobikora. Ryama ngaha gushika mu gitondo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Nuko aca aryama hafi y’ibirenge vyiwe gushika mu gitondo ca kare hatarabona neza, ata muntu yoshobora kumenya uwundi; maze Bowazi aramubwira ati: “Ntihaze hagire uwumenya ko hari umugore yaje ku mbuga yo kugosorerako.”<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Arongera aramubwira ati: “Tega uwo mwitero wambaye uwugumye.” Rusi abigira nk’uko amubwiye, maze asukamwo ingero zitandatu za sayiri aramukorera. Aca asubira mu gisagara.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Rusi ashitse aho inabukwe ari, Nawomi aramubaza ati: “Vyagenze gute, ga mukobwa wanje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Nuko Rusi amudondera ivyo Bowazi yamukoreye vyose <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />kandi arongerako ati: “Yampaye izi ngero zitandatu za sayiri, arambwira ati: ‘Ntuje kwa nyokobukwe iminwe misa.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Maze Nawomi aravuga ati: “Rindira, mukobwa wanje, gushika aho umenyera iyo biherera. Kuko uwo mugabo ataza kuruhuka adatunganije iki kibazo uwu musi.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bowazi arongora Rusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Mu nyuma, Bowazi aduga kw’irembo ry’igisagara yicaraho. Wa mucunguzi yari yavuze ahaciye, Bowazi aravuga ati: “Ingo, mugenzi, wicare hano.” Nuko aragenda aricara.<verse eid="RUT 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Bowazi aca ahamagara icumi mu bakuru b’igisagara aravuga ati: “Nimwicare hano,” na bo baricara. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Maze abwira wa mucunguzi ati: “Nawomi, umwe yagaruka avuye i Mowabu, ariko aragurisha igice c’itongo ryari irya mwenewacu Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Niyumviriye kubikumenyesha kugira ngo urigure imbere y’aba bicaye hano n’imbere y’aba bakuru b’ubwoko bwacu. Niwaba ushaka kuricungura, ubikore. Ariko niwaba udashaka, ubimbwire, ndabimenye. Kuko ata n’umwe afise uburenganzira bwo kubikora atari wewe, jewe nza inyuma yawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Na we avuga ati: “Nzoricungura.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Bowazi na we aravuga ati: “Ku musi uzogurirako iryo tongo rya Nawomi, uzoca utwara na Rusi wa Munyamowabukazi, umupfakazi w’umuhisi, kugira ngo tuzigame izina ry’umuhisi n’itongo ryiwe.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Yumvise ivyo, wa mucunguzi aravuga ati: “Aho rero sinshobora kuricungura kuko vyohava bintera ingorane ku bw’itongo ryanje bwite. Ba ari wewe uricungura. Jewe sinshobora kubikora.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Muri ico gihe muri Isirayeli, kugira ngo umuntu yerekane ko ahaye uwundi uburenganzira bwo gucungura canke kugura, yakura ikirato ciwe akagiha uwo wundi. Ico ni co cemeza ku mugaragaro ukwo gutanga uburenganzira.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Nuko wa mucunguzi abwira Bowazi ati: “Nabe ari wewe urigura.” Akura ikirato ciwe.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Maze Bowazi abwira ba bakuru n’abantu bose bari aho ati: “Uno musi mubaye ivyabona ko nguze na Nawomi itongo rya Elimeleki, Kiliyoni na Mahiloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Kandi nakiriye na Rusi Umunyamowabukazi, umupfakazi wa Mahiloni, nk’umugore wanje, kugira ngo mponore izina ry’uwapfuye n’itongo ryiwe, izina ryiwe ntirizimangane mu muryango wiwe canke mu gisagara avukamwo. Uwu musi mubaye ivyabona!”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Nuko ba bakuru n’abari kw’irembo baravuga bati: “Turi ivyabona. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze agire uwo mugore aje mu nzu yawe nka Rasheli na Leya, abo imiryango yose ya Isirayeli yakomotseko. Uze ugire igihagararo muri Efurata ube rurangiranwa i Betelehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Umuryango wawe uzobe nk’uwa Perezi, uwo Yuda yavyaye kuri Tamari, biciye mu ruvyaro <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoguha kuri uwu mugore akiri muto.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nawomi akikira umwana w’umuhungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Nuko Bowazi atwara Rusi, aba umugore wiwe. Maze aryamana na we, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuha gusama inda, avyara umwana w’umuhungu. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Abagore babwira Nawomi bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahimbazwe, atakuretse ngo ubure uwo kugucungura uwu musi. Izina ry’uwu mwana rize ribe rurangiranwa muri Isirayeli! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Azotuma ubuzima bwawe butotahara kandi agushigikire ugeze mu zabukuru. Kuko umukazana wawe, umwe agukunda kandi akurutira abahungu indwi, ari we yamuvyaye.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Maze Nawomi atora wa mwana, aramukikira amushira mu gikiriza, aba ari we amurera. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Abagore babana na we baravuga bati: “Nawomi yaronse umuhungu.” Nuko bamwita Obedi. Ni we yabaye se wa Isayi, Isayi se wa Dawidi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urutonde rwa ba sekuruza ba Dawidi</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Uwu, rero, ni wo muryango wa Perezi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="RUT 4:18" />
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:18">Perezi yavyaye Hezironi,<verse eid="RUT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hezironi avyara Ramu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:19">Ramu avyara Aminadabu,<verse eid="RUT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu avyara Nahashoni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:20">Nahashoni avyara Salumoni,<verse eid="RUT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salumoni avyara Bowazi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:21">Bowazi avyara Obedi,<verse eid="RUT 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi avyara Isayi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:22">Isayi na we avyara Dawidi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>